## Database

```dotenv
# PostgreSQL async connection string
# Local dev: postgresql+asyncpg://postgres:password@localhost:5432/appdb
# Production: use a connection pooler (PgBouncer / RDS Proxy) DSN
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://user:pass@localhost/dbname

# Connection pool settings (optional — defaults shown)
DB_POOL_SIZE=10
DB_MAX_OVERFLOW=20
DB_POOL_TIMEOUT=30
```

| Variable | Required | Notes |
|----------|----------|-------|
| `DATABASE_URL` | ✅ | Full asyncpg DSN; never use sync `psycopg2://` format here |
| `DB_POOL_SIZE` | — | Active connections; tune per instance type |
| `DB_MAX_OVERFLOW` | — | Burst connections above pool_size |
| `DB_POOL_TIMEOUT` | — | Seconds to wait for a free connection before 503 |

