## Cache / Queue (Redis)

```dotenv
# Redis connection string
# Local dev: redis://localhost:6379
# Production: redis://:password@host:6379/0
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# TTLs (optional — seconds)
CACHE_TTL_SHORT=300      # 5 min — volatile lookups
CACHE_TTL_MEDIUM=3600    # 1 hr  — semi-stable data
CACHE_TTL_LONG=86400     # 1 day — slow-changing reference data
```

| Variable | Required | Notes |
|----------|----------|-------|
| `REDIS_URL` | ✅ | Used for sessions, rate limiting, pub/sub fanout, Streams |
| `CACHE_TTL_*` | — | Override defaults for specific caching tiers |

