```

| Variable | Required | Notes |
|----------|----------|-------|
| `OPENAI_API_KEY` | Depends | Required if any AI features enabled |
| `OPENAI_BASE_URL` | — | Override to use Groq, Together, or local Ollama |
| `SMTP_*` | — | All optional; omit block to disable email |

