## Application

```dotenv
ENVIRONMENT=development   # development | staging | production
LOG_LEVEL=info            # debug | info | warning | error
{% if stack in ["python-fastapi", "python-fastapi-nextjs", "fullstack-desktop"] %}
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:8080
{% endif %}
{% if stack in ["nextjs-fullstack", "python-fastapi-nextjs", "fullstack-desktop"] %}
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
{% endif %}
```

| Variable | Required | Notes |
|----------|----------|-------|
| `ENVIRONMENT` | ✅ | Gates feature flags, debug panels, strict CORS |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | — | `debug` adds noisy request tracing; use `info` in production |
{% if stack in ["python-fastapi", "python-fastapi-nextjs", "fullstack-desktop"] %}
| `CORS_ORIGINS` | — | Comma-separated; wildcard forbidden in production |
{% endif %}

